      "items": [
        {
          "id": "tablets_7_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "From what you have, take an offering for the LORD. Everyone who is willing is to bring an offering of gold, silver and bronze, of yarn and fine linen, of acacia wood and oil.",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "margin": "M",
          "delay": 800,
          "visibleDuration": 0,
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "exitFx": "fade",
          "style": "comic",
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "font": "default",
          "fontSize": 0,
          "speaker": "moses",
          "align": "left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "zIndex": 1
        }
      ],
      "svg": "placeholder"
    },
    {
      "id": "tablets_8",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Bring what your heart gives 🎁",
          "note": "Gold, yarn, acacia wood, oil — each gift small, together more than enough."
        },
        {
          "label": "Wait to see what others bring ⏳",
          "note": "The Tabernacle needs every willing hand. The call stays open."
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "tablets_8_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Everyone who was willing and whose heart moved them came to bring an offering for building the Tabernacle.",
