        {
          "id": "tablets_10_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Bezalel and Oholiab, filled with the Spirit of God with skill and knowledge in every craft, built the tent, the ark, the table, the lampstand and the altar — just as the LORD had commanded.",
